      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-05-22_WidnesExaminer_art0020" n="art0020">
        <p>,</p>
        <p>POULTRY PEN.</p>
        <p>HINTS AND INTERESTING FA CTS AND CHAT FOR AMATEURS.</p>
        <p>lo , t 'irr. .4: • Ab- e f'z• 6 4 RABALAC "</p>
        <p>The meal for " shy " feeding dogs. A recognised body builder for all breeds of dogs, both largo and small.</p>
