        <p>i,.The annual sale of work in connection with a`• parnabas' Mural waslield on Wednesday :Thursday in the Patten Hall, Win- ularleigh-Street. The well-stocked stalls were onvincing indication of the.hard'work which 4,(,1 been put in by way of, preparation.., un Wednesday the opening ceremony was per- theniby Mrs. Parr, under the presidency of Vi car (the Rey. J. H. (T. liollingworth).</p>
