        <head>COUNTY ASYLUM WIN.</head>
        <p>COUNTY ASYLUM WIN.</p>
        <p>The County Asylum had a moderately easy win over the Vulcan Foundry, six of whose men failed to reach the tens, whilst only one of the other side proved unable to do so, seven of the sets falling to the Winwick team. The scores were:—</p>
