        <p>. 21 ' J. Dickenson .. 14 W. H. Horrocks . 21 J. A. Moon .. 21 W. Moon . 9 J. Rothwell 21</p>
        <p>WARRINGTON CEMETERY WORSTED.</p>
        <p>Warrington Cemetery were less fortunate in their tie in the second round of the Club Championship, losing to the Roebuck Inn combination from Flixton. At the conclusion of the game 43 points divided the teams. The individual scores were : Cemetery. W. Butterworth T. Ellison F. Dale W. j. Woods W. Cottam A. Forster ... T. Humphreys J. Ashton Alf. Gleave W. Massey J. Eibby . T. Quarrie</p>
        <p>Roebuck. ... 12 F. Howarth ... .... 13 E. Bunting ... 14 W. W. Wells ... 21 Albert Gleave ... 20 A. Bennett ... 8 G. Corner s</p>
        <p>19 Joe Gleave</p>
        <p>17 H. Unsworth 21 F. Gardner ... 21 H. S. Connelly 7 J. Valentine . 16 S. Saekville .</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-05-22_WidnesExaminer_art0303" n="art0303">
