        <p>LOCAL AMATEUR ROW N 6 G CHAMPIONSHIP.</p>
        <p>Draw: For The Firs! Round.</p>
        <p>The draw' for the first round for the cliampion- ship in connection with the Warringtott and District Amateur Bowling Association, resulted as follows Cemetery v. Junior Conservatives. Senior Conservatives v. Rope and Anchor. Bull's Head v. Penketh Tannery. Bank Quay Bowling Club v. Brewery. Rylands's No. 2 v. Earlestown Vulcan. Rylands's No. 1 v. Walton. King and Queen and Whitecross, byes The first game will be played on Saturday, 29th May</p>
