        <p>ST. JOHN'S WARD. Curry, Christopher, 3/4th South Lancs. Foy, Arthur, Royal Rifles, Lancaster Regimen Libbetter, Christopher J. Richardson, Albert, King's Royal Rifles. Jame, 1/4th South Lancs.</p>
        <p>FAIRFIELD WARD. Allen, Richard, 2/4th South Lanes. Cox, F. Royal Field Artillery. Hollington, George, 1/4th South Lancs.</p>
