        <p>Deaths. FULTQN-SMITH.—On the 20th inst., Sergeant Ivan Fulton-Smith, 9th Royal Scots, died in hos- pital, Rouen, France. HOROBIN.—On the 19th inst., at 51, Sankey-street, Warrington, Henry Richard Horobin, aged 66 years. CASSIDY.—On May 14, at 29. Orchard-street, Joseph Cassidy. aged 81 years. GRAY.—On May 16, at 9. Villars-street, Thomas Gray, aged 56 years. TITCHETT.—On May 16, at 65, Ellesmere-street, John Titchett, aged 55 years. WARD.—On May 17, at 2, Buckley's Yard, Thomas Ward, aged 37 years. MARSHALL.—On May 17, at 44, Norris-street, Jane Marshall, aged 65 years. TREVOR.—On May 17, at 2. Sutton-street, Harriet Ann Trevor, aged 70 years.</p>
